<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">cattail-down-cloak</ansi> (tailoring recipe)

A long quilted cloak of close-woven linen lined with loose cattail
down, finished with a horn toggle and a soft hood. Light as held
breath across the shoulders, warm out of all proportion to its
weight, and quiet — the down soaks up the rustle of cloth on
cloth.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       tailoring (minimum 20)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     loom
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> cattail down (x4), cloth strip (x3),
                 thread spool (x2)

